+	(GSThemeInstallBackendDefaults): New function.  Install the
+	GSBackHandlesWindowDecorations default from the GSThemeDomain of the
+	theme named by the GSTheme default, without loading the theme,
+	unless the user has set GSBackHandlesWindowDecorations or
+	GSX11HandlesWindowDecorations.  A theme that draws the window
+	decorations itself can then turn GNUstep-drawn decorations on: the
+	backend reads that default when the display server is created,
+	before the theme is loaded.
